test mat-sp-5 {an untyped identity function carries the contract through its semantic instance (no generic syntax): a typed array stays typed, a raw one stays raw} -body {
    list [maLast "import mutable_array\nfn identity(x):\n    x\nidentity(mutable_array::create(1, \"a\"))"] \
